{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":4},"Miraculous, le film (Ladybug & Cat Noir Awakening)","La super-héroïne, qui a conquis le cœur de millions de fans à travers le monde, débarque pour la première fois au cinéma ! Ladybug va devoir unir ses forces avec Chat Noir, le charismatique justicier masqué qui n’a pas sa langue dans sa poche, pour affronter le Papillon et sa horde de super-vilains, alors que ceux-ci menacent de détruire Paris. Mais, alors que les deux héros se rapprochent, Marinette ignore que derrière son mystérieux complice se cache Adrien, le camarade de classe dont elle est amoureuse…",[],{"type":5,"id":6,"slug":7,"title":8,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":25,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":61,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_136","fr2023-136-miraculous-le-film",{"native":9,"english":10},"Miraculous, le film","Ladybug & Cat Noir Awakening",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2023-07-05",2023,"Animation",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Jeremy Zag","jeremy-zag",1985,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[26,27],"Action","Superhero",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/78/16/266318/format_page/miraculous-le-film.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QidIZNU91Xs",{"native":2,"english":32},"",[34],{"country":23,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38,45,51,55],{"person":39,"role":44},{"id":40,"slug":41,"name":40,"birthYear":42,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":43},"Antoine Tomé","antoine-tome",1951,[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":46,"role":44},{"id":47,"slug":48,"name":47,"birthYear":49,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":50},"Gilbert Lévy","gilbert-levy",1949,[],{"person":52,"role":54},{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":53},[],"Direc